{"article_ids": ["332f2200bcdcb827"], "canonical_title": "Quoting Calif Research", "category": "security", "confidence": 0.92, "description": "Researchers released a demo called WeWorm that can infect devices through WeChat voice calls without any user interaction. The worm works on both iOS and Android; the victim does not need to answer the call, and even if they do, they hear nothing. The team used AI to discover the underlying bug and wrote a remote code execution exploit in about two days, then built the worm in an additional week.", "entities": ["term:rce"], "first_seen": "2026-09-10T00:56:41Z", "id": "evt_332f2200bcdcb827", "importance_score": 6.213, "last_updated": "2026-09-10T00:56:41Z", "source_ids": ["simon-willison"]}
